## Structural Changes (Frontend)

### AdminLayout Component
The sidebar and top bar need to be extracted from `DashboardScreen.jsx` into a reusable `AdminLayout` so each page doesn't duplicate the navigation.

**Sidebar Navigation Links:**
1. 📊 Dashboard (Analytics)
2. ✅ Agency Approvals
3. 👥 User Directory
4. 📦 Package Moderation *(greyed out until Week 2)*

### Router Update
`App.jsx` will wrap all protected pages inside `AdminLayout` using React Router's nested routes.

